<title>AUSTRIA: ALL OPEC DELEGATION HEADS START TALKS - DELEGATES.</title>
<headline>ALL OPEC DELEGATION HEADS START TALKS - DELEGATES.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>All 11 OPEC heads of delegation have arrived at the hotel suite of the President Abdullah Salem al-Badri, the Libyan minister, for the producer group's closed session, delegates said.  </p>
<p>Earlier, Kuwait's Isa al-Mazeedi reiterated that he expects OPEC to agree at its summer conference here on a freeze of its 25.03 million barrels per day (bpd) production ceiling.</p>
<p>Actual OPEC output, however, is running closer to around 27 million bpd.</p>
<p>Indonesia's told reporters on his way to the &quot;consultative&quot; session that the meeting was &quot;to do with the quotas and the problem we face&quot;.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom +431 713 2002</p>
</text>
